{
  "_doc": "The room list's order (D03.3): pending invites, then rooms that are personal and new — an unread DM or a room with an unread mention (highlight) — then favourites, then an active call, then anything else unread, then recency (newest first; none last), then name. Muted rooms never count as unread. Owned by the desktop (crates/app/src/testvectors/room-sort.json, nav.rs sort_rooms); the web's src/features/nav/testvectors/room-sort.json is a byte copy (model.ts sortRooms). rows are the input in list order; out = the ids sorted.",
